#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Mipangilio ya Jumla"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Service Check Name"
msgstr "Jina la Ukaguzi wa Huduma"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The name that is displayed for this Service Check, and is included in any Alert notifications."
msgstr "Jina linaloonyeshwa kwa Ukaguzi huu wa Huduma, na linajumuishwa katika arifa zozote za Tahadhari."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many attempts"
msgstr "Idadi ya majaribio"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Cacti attempts to run each test multiple times. The first successful attempt ends the testing and records the success. If none of the attempts are successful, the test is terminated and a failure is recorded. High number causes log test duration."
msgstr "Cacti hujaribu kuendesha kila jaribio mara nyingi. Jaribio la kwanza linalofaulu humaliza upimaji na kurekodi mafanikio. Iwapo hakuna jaribio linalofaulu, upimaji husitishwa na kushindwa hurekodiwa. Idadi kubwa husababisha muda mrefu wa jaribio."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable test"
msgstr "Washa jaribio"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Uncheck this box to disable this test from being checked."
msgstr "Ondoa tiki kwenye kisanduku hiki ili kuzima jaribio hili lisikaguliwe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable run script for this test"
msgstr "Washa uendeshaji wa hati kwa jaribio hili"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If the global Command Execution function is enabled, you can set here whether the script should be run for this test or not."
msgstr "Ikiwa kitendakazi cha jumla cha Utekelezaji wa Amri kimewashwa, unaweza kuweka hapa iwapo hati inapaswa kuendeshwa kwa jaribio hili au la."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Poller"
msgstr "Kikusanyaji"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Poller on which the test will run"
msgstr "Kikusanyaji ambacho jaribio litaendeshwa juu yake"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Type of service"
msgstr "Aina ya huduma"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "What type of service?"
msgstr "Aina gani ya huduma?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "IP Address or DNS name of server"
msgstr "Anwani ya IP au jina la DNS la seva"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "You can specify another port (example.com:5000) otherwise default will be used. For IPv6 numeric address use [ip:ad:dr:es:fo:rma:at]. For DOH (DNS over HTTPS) use here name of server (example 10.10.10.10, cloudflare-dns.com, ..)"
msgstr "Unaweza kubainisha mlango mwingine (example.com:5000) la sivyo chaguomsingi itatumika. Kwa anwani ya nambari ya IPv6 tumia [ip:ad:dr:es:fo:rma:at]. Kwa DOH (DNS kupitia HTTPS) tumia hapa jina la seva (mfano 10.10.10.10, cloudflare-dns.com, ..)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Resolve DNS to Address"
msgstr "Tafsiri DNS hadi Anwani"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enter an IP Address to force DNS name to resolve to. Leaving blank will use DNS Resolution instead."
msgstr "Ingiza Anwani ya IP ili kulazimisha jina la DNS litafsiriwe kwayo. Kuacha wazi kutatumia Utatuzi wa DNS badala yake."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Service settings"
msgstr "Mipangilio ya huduma"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Select correct credential"
msgstr "Chagua kitambulisho sahihi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP OID"
msgstr "OID ya SNMP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert SNMP OID"
msgstr "Weka SNMP OID"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH command"
msgstr "Amri ya SSH"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert SSH command with full path, result of command will be returned"
msgstr "Weka amri ya SSH pamoja na njia kamili, matokeo ya amri yatarudishwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Your own CA and intermediate certs"
msgstr "Vyeti vyako mwenyewe vya CA na vya kati"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP Search"
msgstr "Utafutaji wa LDAP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP search filter, it could be ,OU=anygroup,DC=example,DC=com"
msgstr "Kichujio cha utafutaji wa LDAP, kinaweza kuwa ,OU=anygroup,DC=example,DC=com"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "DNS Name for Query"
msgstr "Jina la DNS kwa Hoji"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "DNS name for querying. For DOH (DNS over HTTPS) use /resolve?name=example.com or /dns-query?name=example.com&type=A. For plaintext DNS A and AAAA records will be returned"
msgstr "Jina la DNS la kuhoji. Kwa DOH (DNS kupitia HTTPS) tumia /resolve?name=example.com au /dns-query?name=example.com&type=A. Kwa DNS ya maandishi wazi, rekodi za A na AAAA zitarudishwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Path Part of URL"
msgstr "Sehemu ya Njia ya URL"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For web service insert at least \"/\" or something like \"/any/path/\"."
msgstr "Kwa huduma ya wavuti weka angalau \"/\" au kitu kama \"/njia/yoyote/\"."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requires Authentication"
msgstr "Inahitaji Uthibitishaji"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check this box if the site will normally return a 401 Error as it requires a username and password."
msgstr "Tiki kisanduku hiki ikiwa eneo kwa kawaida litarudisha Hitilafu ya 401 kwani linahitaji jina la mtumiaji na nenosiri."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Proxy Server"
msgstr "Seva ya Proksi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If this connection text requires a proxy, select it here.  Otherwise choose 'None'."
msgstr "Ikiwa maandishi haya ya muunganisho yanahitaji proksi, ichague hapa. Vinginevyo chagua 'Hakuna'."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check Certificate"
msgstr "Kagua Cheti"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to validate the certificate. Default on, turn off if you the site uses a self-signed certificate."
msgstr "Ikiwa unatumia SSL, teua kisanduku hiki ikiwa unataka kuthibitisha cheti. Chaguo-msingi imewashwa, zima ikiwa eneo linatumia cheti kilichosainiwa chenyewe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check and notify Certificate expiration"
msgstr "Kagua na uarifu kuisha kwa muda wa Cheti"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to check the certificate expiration. You can set in settings how many days before expiration notify.."
msgstr "Ikiwa unatumia SSL, teua kisanduku hiki ikiwa unataka kukagua kuisha kwa muda wa cheti. Unaweza kuweka katika mipangilio ni siku ngapi kabla ya kuisha muda utoe arifa.."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Vigezo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How Often to Test"
msgstr "Marudio ya Kujaribu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Test every xth poller run"
msgstr "Jaribu kila mwendesho wa x wa kikusanyaji"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Trigger"
msgstr "Kichocheo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many times the service must be DOWN before an alert email is triggered."
msgstr "Ni mara ngapi huduma lazima iwe IMEZIMIKA kabla ya barua pepe ya tahadhari kuanzishwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Long duration alert"
msgstr "Arifa ya muda mrefu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If the test time is greater than this value more times in a row, send a notification. Related to variable Duration count. The test inherits the maximum runtime from the settings. If a higher value is set here, the maximum runtime is this value + 2 seconds."
msgstr "Ikiwa muda wa jaribio ni mkubwa kuliko thamani hii mara nyingi mfululizo, tuma arifa. Inahusiana na kigezo cha idadi ya Muda. Jaribio hurithi muda wa juu zaidi wa utekelezaji kutoka kwa mipangilio. Ikiwa thamani ya juu zaidi imewekwa hapa, muda wa juu zaidi wa utekelezaji ni thamani hii + sekunde 2."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Number of duration violations in a row"
msgstr "Idadi ya ukiukaji wa muda mfululizo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many times the duration trigger must be exceeded in a row for a notification to be sent"
msgstr "Ni mara ngapi kichocheo cha muda lazima kipitwe mfululizo ili arifa itumwe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Verification Strings"
msgstr "Mifuatano ya Uthibitishaji"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String"
msgstr "Mfuatano wa Kutafuta Jibu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for in the response for a live and working service."
msgstr "Hii ni tungo ya kutafuta katika jibu kwa huduma iliyo hai na inayofanya kazi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String - Maintenance"
msgstr "Mfuatano wa Kutafuta Jibu - Matengenezo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for on the Maintenance .  The Service Check will check for this string if the above string is not found.  If found, it means that the service is under maintenance."
msgstr "Hii ni tungo ya kutafuta kwenye Matengenezo. Ukaguzi wa Huduma utatafuta tungo hii ikiwa tungo iliyo hapo juu haitapatikana. Ikipatikana, inamaanisha kuwa huduma iko chini ya matengenezo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String - Failed"
msgstr "Mfuatano wa Kutafuta Jibu - Imeshindwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for a known failure in the service response.  The Service Check will only alert if this string is found, ignoring any timeout issues and the search strings above."
msgstr "Hii ni tungo ya kutafuta hitilafu inayojulikana katika jibu la huduma. Ukaguzi wa Huduma utatoa arifa tu ikiwa tungo hii itapatikana, ukipuuza matatizo yoyote ya muda kuisha na tungo za utafutaji zilizo hapo juu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Notification Settings"
msgstr "Mipangilio ya Arifa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Email notification"
msgstr "Arifa ya Barua Pepe"

#: includes/arrays.php
