msgid "OAuth Client secret"
msgstr "Siri ya Mteja wa OAuth"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Token name"
msgstr "Jina la tokeni"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Token value"
msgstr "Thamani ya tokeni"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "<b>Can be used for a lot of service checks:</b><br/><i>Http/https</i> - optional, when it is set, try HTTP basic auth<br/><i>SMTP on port 587</i> - optional. Without a username/password, only the server response is tested. With a username and password, login is also performed<br/><i>Imap, imaps, pop3, pop3s, ftp</i> - optional. For anonymous ftp, use username \"anonymous\" and email address as password<br/><i>LDAP, smb, smbs</i> - required<br/><i>MQTT</i> - optional<br/><i>SCP, SSH command</i> - you can use this method or private key method"
msgstr "<b>Inaweza kutumika kwa ukaguzi mwingi wa huduma:</b><br/><i>Http/https</i> - hiari, ikiwekwa, jaribu uthibitishaji msingi wa HTTP<br/><i>SMTP kwenye bandari 587</i> - hiari. Bila jina la mtumiaji/nenosiri, ni jibu la seva pekee linalojaribiwa. Kwa jina la mtumiaji na nenosiri, kuingia pia kunafanywa<br/><i>Imap, imaps, pop3, pop3s, ftp</i> - hiari. Kwa ftp isiyojulikana, tumia jina la mtumiaji \"anonymous\" na anwani ya barua pepe kama nenosiri<br/><i>LDAP, smb, smbs</i> - inahitajika<br/><i>MQTT</i> - hiari<br/><i>SCP, amri ya SSH</i> - unaweza kutumia mbinu hii au mbinu ya ufunguo wa faragha"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - Basic HTTP auth. Username and password are required"
msgstr "Rest API - Uthibitishaji wa msingi wa HTTP. Jina la mtumiaji na nenosiri yanahitajika"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - API key auth<br/>Auth is sent in HTTP header, custom header or POST method. Credentials in URL are not supported.<br/>Insert API key name and value. Both values are required. For HTTP header the name <i>Bearer or apikey or \"\"</i> is usually used (Authorization: Bearer apivalue). For custom header <i>X-API-Key</i> is usually used (X-Api-Key: keyvalue). For POST <i>api_key</i> is usually used."
msgstr "Rest API - Uthibitishaji wa ufunguo wa API<br/>Uthibitishaji hutumwa katika kichwa cha HTTP, kichwa maalum au mbinu ya POST. Vitambulisho katika URL havitumiki.<br/>Ingiza jina na thamani ya ufunguo wa API. Thamani zote mbili zinahitajika. Kwa kichwa cha HTTP jina <i>Bearer au apikey au \"\"</i> hutumika kwa kawaida (Authorization: Bearer apivalue). Kwa kichwa maalum <i>X-API-Key</i> hutumika kwa kawaida (X-Api-Key: keyvalue). Kwa POST <i>api_key</i> hutumika kwa kawaida."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - OAuth2/Bearer token auth<br/>You can have key/token from server and insert it here or use auth flow with credentials. Username and password are sent Json encoded."
msgstr "Rest API - Uthibitishaji wa tokeni ya OAuth2/Bearer<br/>Unaweza kupata ufunguo/tokeni kutoka kwa seva na kuiingiza hapa au utumie mtiririko wa uthibitishaji wenye vitambulisho. Jina la mtumiaji na nenosiri hutumwa zikiwa zimesimbwa kwa JSON."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - Cookie based auth - both values are required. After login, cookie is returned"
msgstr "Rest API - Uthibitishaji unaotegemea kidakuzi - thamani zote mbili zinahitajika. Baada ya kuingia, kidakuzi hurejeshwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v1 or v2 - required, insert community name here"
msgstr "SNMP v1 au v2 - inahitajika, weka jina la jamii hapa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v3 - The security level determines which parameters are required"
msgstr "SNMP v3 - Kiwango cha usalama huamua ni vigezo vipi vinavyohitajika"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH private key - Can be used for SCP or SSH command test. These test can use username/password too"
msgstr "Ufunguo wa faragha wa SSH - Unaweza kutumika kwa majaribio ya SCP au amri ya SSH. Majaribio haya yanaweza kutumia jina la mtumiaji/nenosiri pia"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "It only checks whether the web server is responding. If username/password credential is used, it will try Basic HTTP auth."
msgstr "Inakagua tu ikiwa seva ya wavuti inajibu. Ikiwa kitambulisho cha jina la mtumiaji/nenosiri kinatumika, itajaribu uthibitishaji wa Basic HTTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as HTTP plaintext but adds the ability to test certificates."
msgstr "Sawa na maandishi wazi ya HTTP lakini huongeza uwezo wa kujaribu vyeti."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "It only checks whether the SMTP server is responding. No authentication. You will see server login banner and ehlo response."
msgstr "Inakagua tu ikiwa seva ya SMTP inajibu. Hakuna uthibitishaji. Utaona bango la kuingia la seva na jibu la ehlo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted + STARTTLS. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate. Without username and password, you will see server login banner and ehlo response. With credential, login will be performed"
msgstr "Bila usimbaji fiche + STARTTLS. Inawezekana pia kujaribu uhalali wa cheti. Bila jina la mtumiaji na nenosiri, utaona bango la kuingia la seva na jibu la ehlo. Ukiwa na vitambulisho, kuingia kutafanywa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted connection on default port 465. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate. With username and password AUTH LOGIN will be tested."
msgstr "Muunganisho uliosimbwa kwa njia fiche kwenye mlango chaguomsingi 465. Inawezekana pia kupima uhalali wa cheti. Kwa jina la mtumiaji na nenosiri AUTH LOGIN itajaribiwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted IMAP connection. Without credential, only connection will be tested. You will see only login banner. With credential login will be tested and try to read list of messages. You can use AUTHENTICATE PLAIN or AUTHENTICATE LOGIN method."
msgstr "Muunganisho wa IMAP usiosimbwa kwa njia fiche. Bila vitambulisho, muunganisho pekee ndio utajaribiwa. Utaona bango la kuingia pekee. Ukiwa na vitambulisho kuingia kutajaribiwa na kujaribu kusoma orodha ya ujumbe. Unaweza kutumia mbinu ya AUTHENTICATE PLAIN au AUTHENTICATE LOGIN."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as unencrypted IMAP but after login STARTTLS is used. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate after STARTTLS."
msgstr "Sawa na IMAP isiyosimbwa kwa njia fiche lakini baada ya kuingia STARTTLS hutumika. Inawezekana pia kujaribu uhalali wa cheti baada ya STARTTLS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted IMAP, you can try login and test certificate and user login"
msgstr "IMAP iliyosimbwa kwa njia fiche, unaweza kujaribu kuingia na kupima cheti na kuingia kwa mtumiaji"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted POP3 connection. Without credential, only connection will be tested. You will see only login banner. With credential login will be tested and try to read list of messages"
msgstr "Muunganisho wa POP3 usiosimbwa kwa njia fiche. Bila vitambulisho, muunganisho pekee ndio utajaribiwa. Utaona bango la kuingia pekee. Ukiwa na vitambulisho kuingia kutajaribiwa na kujaribu kusoma orodha ya ujumbe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as unencrypted POP3 but after login STARTTLS is used. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate after STARTTLS."
msgstr "Sawa na POP3 isiyosimbwa kwa njia fiche lakini baada ya kuingia STARTTLS hutumika. Inawezekana pia kujaribu uhalali wa cheti baada ya STARTTLS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted POP3, you can try login and test certificate and user login."
msgstr "POP3 iliyosimbwa kwa njia fiche, unaweza kujaribu kuingia na kupima cheti na kuingia kwa mtumiaji."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try to resolve DNS record on specified DNS server"
msgstr "Jaribu kutatua rekodi ya DNS kwenye seva ya DNS iliyobainishwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try DNS over HTTPS."
msgstr "Jaribu DNS kupitia HTTPS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All parameters are required. Perform unencrypted LDAP login and search"
msgstr "Vigezo vyote vinahitajika. Tekeleza kuingia na utafutaji wa LDAP usiosimbwa kwa njia fiche"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All parameters are required. Perform encrypted LDAP login and search"
msgstr "Vigezo vyote vinahitajika. Tekeleza kuingia na utafutaji wa LDAP uliosimbwa kwa njia fiche"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted FTP connection, login and try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt). For anonymous connection use login *anonymous* and email address as password. The content of the file is returned."
msgstr "Muunganisho wa FTP usiosimbwa kwa njia fiche, ingia na ujaribu kupakua faili iliyobainishwa katika njia (/path/to/file.txt). Kwa muunganisho usiojulikana tumia kuingia *anonymous* na anwani ya barua pepe kama nenosiri. Maudhui ya faili yanarejeshwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt) from TFTP server. The content of the file is returned."
msgstr "Jaribu kupakua faili iliyobainishwa katika njia (/path/to/file.txt) kutoka kwa seva ya TFTP. Maudhui ya faili yanarudishwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted SCP connection, login and try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt)."
msgstr "Muunganisho wa SCP uliosimbwa kwa njia fiche, ingia na ujaribu kupakua faili iliyoainishwa katika njia (/path/to/file.txt)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SMB protocol, username and password are required. Try to login and download file."
msgstr "Jaribu itifaki ya SMB, jina la mtumiaji na nenosiri vinahitajika. Jaribu kuingia na kupakua faili."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Connect to MQTT server and listen for any message. You can specify topic in Path (bedroom/temp), blank for any topic. For this test is recommended increase \"Long duration alert\""
msgstr "Unganisha na seva ya MQTT na usikilize ujumbe wowote. Unaweza kubainisha mada katika Njia (bedroom/temp), acha wazi kwa mada yoyote. Kwa jaribio hili inashauriwa kuongeza \"Arifa ya muda mrefu\""

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with basic HTTP auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Jaribio la REST API kwa uthibitishaji msingi wa HTTP. Andaa kitambulisho kwanza."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with API key auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Jaribio la REST API kwa uthibitishaji wa ufunguo wa API. Andaa kitambulisho kwanza."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with Oauth2. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Jaribio la REST API kwa Oauth2. Andaa kitambulisho kwanza."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with cookie auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Jaribio la REST API kwa uthibitishaji wa kuki. Andaa kitambulisho kwanza."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SNMP get method. Output for specified OID is returned. Credential is required, you have to prepare SNMP v.1,2 or v3 credential first."
msgstr "Jaribu mbinu ya SNMP get. Matokeo ya OID iliyobainishwa yanarudishwa. Kitambulisho kinahitajika, lazima uandae kitambulisho cha SNMP v.1,2 au v3 kwanza."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SNMP walk method. Output for specified OID is returned. Credential is required, you have to prepare SNMP v.1,2 or v3 credential first."
msgstr "Jaribu mbinu ya SNMP walk. Matokeo ya OID iliyobainishwa yanarudishwa. Kitambulisho kinahitajika, lazima uandae kitambulisho cha SNMP v.1,2 au v3 kwanza."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Use ssh and connect to remote host. After login run specified command and return output. Username and password or private key is possible."
msgstr "Tumia SSH na uunganishe na kipangishi cha mbali. Baada ya kuingia endesha amri iliyoainishwa na urudishe matokeo. Jina la mtumiaji na nenosiri au ufunguo wa faragha inawezekana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SFTP protocol on port 22, username and password and path are required. Try to do directory listing of path."
msgstr "Itifaki ya SFTP kwenye mlango wa 22; jina la mtumiaji, nenosiri na njia zinahitajika. Jaribu kuorodhesha saraka ya njia."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All fine. Proceed as usual."
msgstr "Kila kitu kiko sawa. Endelea kama kawaida."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The URL you passed to libcurl used a protocol that this libcurl does not support. The support might be a compile-time option that you did not use, it can be a misspelled protocol string or just a protocol libcurl has no code for."
msgstr "URL uliyopitisha kwa libcurl ilitumia itifaki ambayo libcurl hii haiungi mkono. Usaidizi unaweza kuwa chaguo la wakati wa kukusanya msimbo ambalo hukutumia, inaweza kuwa mfuatano wa itifaki ulioandikwa vibaya au itifaki tu ambayo libcurl haina msimbo wake."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Early initialization code failed. This is likely to be an internal error or problem, or a resource problem where something fundamental could not get done at init time."
msgstr "Msimbo wa uanzishaji wa mapema umeshindwa. Hii huenda ikawa hitilafu ya ndani au tatizo la rasilimali ambapo jambo la msingi halikuweza kufanywa wakati wa uanzishaji."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The URL was not properly formatted."
msgstr "URL haikuwa na umbizo sahihi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A requested feature, protocol or option was not found built-in in this libcurl due to a build-time decision. This means that a feature or option was not enabled or explicitly disabled when libcurl was built and in order to get it to function you have to get a rebuilt libcurl."
msgstr "Kipengele, itifaki au chaguo lililoombwa halikupatikana ndani ya libcurl hii kutokana na uamuzi wa wakati wa ujenzi. Hii ina maana kuwa kipengele au chaguo halikuwashwa au lilizimwa waziwazi wakati libcurl ilipojengwa na ili lifanye kazi lazima upate libcurl iliyojengwa upya."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not resolve proxy. The given proxy host could not be resolved."
msgstr "Haikuweza kutatua proksi. Kipangishi cha proksi kilichotolewa hakikutatuliwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not resolve host. The given remote host was not resolved."
msgstr "Haikuweza kutatua kipangishi. Kipangishi cha mbali kilichotolewa hakikutatuliwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to connect() to host or proxy."
msgstr "Imeshindwa kufanya connect() kwenye kipangishi au proksi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The server sent data libcurl could not parse. This error code was known as CURLE_FTP_WEIRD_SERVER_REPLY before 7.51.0."
msgstr "Seva ilituma data ambayo libcurl haikuweza kuchanganua. Msimbo huu wa hitilafu ulijulikana kama CURLE_FTP_WEIRD_SERVER_REPLY kabla ya 7.51.0."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "We were denied access to the resource given in the URL. For FTP, this occurs while trying to change to the remote directory."
msgstr "Tulinyimwa ufikiaji wa rasilimali iliyotolewa kwenye URL. Kwa FTP, hili hutokea wakati wa kujaribu kubadilisha hadi saraka ya mbali."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "While waiting for the server to connect back when an active FTP session is used, an error code was sent over the control connection or similar."
msgstr "Wakati wa kusubiri seva iunganishe tena wakati kipindi amilifu cha FTP kinapotumika, msimbo wa hitilafu ulitumwa kupitia muunganisho wa udhibiti au sawa na huo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "After having sent the FTP password to the server, libcurl expects a proper reply. This error code indicates that an unexpected code was returned."
msgstr "Baada ya kutuma nenosiri la FTP kwenye seva, libcurl inatarajia jibu sahihi. Msimbo huu wa hitilafu unaonyesha kuwa msimbo usiotarajiwa ulirejeshwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "During an active FTP session while waiting for the server to connect, the CURLOPT_ACCEPTTIMEOUT_MS (or the internal default) timeout expired."
msgstr "Wakati wa kipindi amilifu cha FTP huku ikisubiri seva kuunganisha, muda wa kusubiri wa CURLOPT_ACCEPTTIMEOUT_MS (au chaguomsingi la ndani) uliisha."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Libcurl failed to get a sensible result back from the server as a response to either a PASV or a EPSV command. The server is flawed."
msgstr "Libcurl ilishindwa kupata matokeo yanayoeleweka kutoka kwa seva kama jibu la amri ya PASV au EPSV. Seva ina kasoro."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "FTP servers return a 227-line as a response to a PASV command. If libcurl fails to parse that line, this return code is passed back."
msgstr "Seva za FTP hurejesha mstari wa 227 kama jibu kwa amri ya PASV. Ikiwa libcurl itashindwa kuchanganua mstari huo, msimbo huu wa urejeshaji hurudishwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An internal failure to lookup the host used for the new connection."
msgstr "Hitilafu ya ndani ya kutafuta kipangishi kilichotumiwa kwa muunganisho mpya."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem was detected in the HTTP2 framing layer. This is somewhat generic and can be one out of several problems, see the error buffer for details."
msgstr "Tatizo liligunduliwa katika safu ya fremu ya HTTP2. Hili ni la kijumla kiasi na linaweza kuwa mojawapo ya matatizo kadhaa, angalia bafa ya hitilafu kwa maelezo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Received an error when trying to set the transfer mode to binary or ASCII."
msgstr "Imepokea hitilafu wakati wa kujaribu kuweka hali ya uhamishaji kuwa binari au ASCII."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A file transfer was shorter or larger than expected. This happens when the server first reports an expected transfer size, and then delivers data that does not match the previously given size."
msgstr "Uhamisho wa faili ulikuwa mfupi au mkubwa kuliko ilivyotarajiwa. Hii hutokea wakati seva inaporipoti kwanza ukubwa wa uhamisho unaotarajiwa, kisha inatoa data ambayo hailingani na ukubwa uliotolewa awali."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This was either a weird reply to a 'RETR' command or a zero byte transfer complete."
msgstr "Hili lilikuwa jibu lisilo la kawaida kwa amri ya 'RETR' au uhamisho uliokamilika wa baiti sifuri."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Obsolete Error"
msgstr "Hitilafu Iliyopitwa na Wakati"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Not used in modern versions."
msgstr "Haitumiki katika matoleo ya kisasa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When sending custom \"QUOTE\" commands to the remote server, one of the commands returned an error code that was 400 or higher (for FTP) or otherwise indicated unsuccessful completion of the command."
msgstr "Wakati wa kutuma amri maalum za \"QUOTE\" kwa seva ya mbali, moja ya amri ilirejesha msimbo wa hitilafu ambao ulikuwa 400 au zaidi (kwa FTP) au vinginevyo ilionyesha kukamilika kusikofanikiwa kwa amri."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is returned if CURLOPT_FAILONERROR is set true and the HTTP server returns an error code that is >= 400."
msgstr "Hii hurejeshwa ikiwa CURLOPT_FAILONERROR imewekwa kuwa true na seva ya HTTP ikirejesha msimbo wa kosa ambao ni >= 400."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An error occurred when writing received data to a local file, or an error was returned to libcurl from a write callback."
msgstr "Hitilafu ilitokea wakati wa kuandika data iliyopokelewa kwenye faili ya ndani, au hitilafu ilirejeshwa kwa libcurl kutoka kwa callback ya kuandika."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed starting the upload. For FTP, the server typically denied the STOR command. The error buffer usually contains the server's explanation for this."
msgstr "Imeshindwa kuanza kupakia. Kwa FTP, seva kwa kawaida ilikataa amri ya STOR. Bafa ya hitilafu kwa kawaida huwa na maelezo ya seva kuhusu hili."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "There was a problem reading a local file or an error returned by the read callback."
msgstr "Kulikuwa na tatizo la kusoma faili ya ndani au kosa lilirudishwa na kipengele cha kurejesha usomaji."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A memory allocation request failed. This is serious badness and things are severely screwed up if this ever occurs."
msgstr "Ombi la kutenga kumbukumbu lilishindwa. Hii ni hitilafu mbaya sana na mambo yameharibika vibaya ikiwa hili litawahi kutokea."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Operation timeout. The specified time-out period was reached according to the conditions."
msgstr "Muda wa operesheni umeisha. Kipindi cha muda kilichobainishwa kilifikiwa kulingana na masharti."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP PORT command returned error. This mostly happens when you have not specified a good enough address for libcurl to use. See CURLOPT_FTPPORT."
msgstr "Amri ya FTP PORT ilirudisha hitilafu. Hii hutokea zaidi wakati hujabainisha anwani inayofaa ya kutosha kwa libcurl kutumia. Tazama CURLOPT_FTPPORT."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP REST command returned error. This should never happen if the server is sane."
msgstr "Amri ya FTP REST ilirudisha hitilafu. Hili halipaswi kamwe kutokea ikiwa seva inafanya kazi ipasavyo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The server does not support or accept range requests."
msgstr "Seva haiauni au haikubali maombi ya masafa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is an odd error that mainly occurs due to internal confusion."
msgstr "Hili ni kosa lisilo la kawaida ambalo hutokea zaidi kutokana na mkanganyiko wa ndani."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem occurred somewhere in the SSL/TLS handshake. You really want the error buffer and read the message there as it pinpoints the problem slightly more. Could be certificates (file formats, paths, permissions), passwords, and others."
msgstr "Tatizo lilitokea mahali fulani katika muunganisho wa SSL/TLS. Unahitaji bafa ya hitilafu na usome ujumbe uliopo hapo kwani unabainisha tatizo kwa usahihi zaidi. Huenda ikawa vyeti (miundo ya faili, njia, ruhusa), nenosiri, na mengineyo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The download could not be resumed because the specified offset was out of the file boundary."
msgstr "Upakuaji haukuweza kuendelezwa kwa sababu mwacho uliobainishwa ulikuwa nje ya mpaka wa faili."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A file given with FILE:// could not be opened. Most likely because the file path does not identify an existing file. Did you check file permissions?"
msgstr "Faili iliyotolewa na FILE:// haikuweza kufunguliwa. Uwezekano mkubwa ni kwa sababu njia ya faili haitambui faili iliyopo. Je, ulikagua ruhusa za faili?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP cannot bind. LDAP bind operation failed."
msgstr "LDAP haiwezi kuunganisha. Operesheni ya kuunganisha LDAP imeshindwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP search failed."
msgstr "Utafutaji wa LDAP umeshindwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Function not found. A required zlib function was not found."
msgstr "Kitendakazi hakikupatikana. Kitendakazi kinachohitajika cha zlib hakikupatikana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Aborted by callback. A callback returned \"abort\" to libcurl."
msgstr "Imekatishwa na kipengele cha kurejesha. Kipengele cha kurejesha kilirudisha \"abort\" kwa libcurl."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A function was called with a bad parameter."
msgstr "Kitendakazi kiliitwa kikiwa na kigezo kibaya."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Interface error. A specified outgoing interface could not be used. Set which interface to use for outgoing connections' source IP address with URLOPT_INTERFACE."
msgstr "Hitilafu ya kiolesura. Kiolesura kilichobainishwa cha kutoka hakikuweza kutumika. Weka kiolesura cha kutumia kwa anwani ya IP ya chanzo cha miunganisho inayotoka kwa kutumia URLOPT_INTERFACE."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Too many redirects. When following redirects, libcurl hit the maximum amount. Set your limit with CURLOPT_MAXREDIRS."
msgstr "Uelekezaji kwingi mno. Wakati wa kufuata uelekezaji, libcurl ilifikia kiwango cha juu zaidi. Weka kikomo chako ukitumia CURLOPT_MAXREDIRS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An option passed to libcurl is not recognized/known. Refer to the appropriate documentation. This is most likely a problem in the program that uses libcurl. The error buffer might contain more specific information about which exact option it concerns."
msgstr "Chaguo lililopitishwa kwa libcurl halitambuliwi/halijulikani. Rejelea nyaraka zinazofaa. Hili huenda likawa tatizo katika programu inayotumia libcurl. Bafa ya hitilafu inaweza kuwa na maelezo mahususi zaidi kuhusu chaguo halisi linalohusika."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An option passed in to a setopt was wrongly formatted. See error message for details about what option."
msgstr "Chaguo lililopitishwa kwa setopt lilikuwa na muundo usio sahihi. Tazama ujumbe wa hitilafu kwa maelezo kuhusu ni chaguo gani."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Nothing was returned from the server, and under the circumstances, getting nothing is considered an error."
msgstr "Hakuna kilichorejeshwa kutoka kwa seva, na chini ya hali hii, kutopata chochote kunachukuliwa kuwa hitilafu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The specified crypto engine was not found."
msgstr "Injini ya usimbaji iliyobainishwa haikupatikana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed setting the selected SSL crypto engine as default."
msgstr "Imeshindwa kuweka injini ya usimbaji fiche ya SSL iliyochaguliwa kuwa chaguomsingi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed sending network data."
msgstr "Imeshindwa kutuma data ya mtandao."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failure with receiving network data."
msgstr "Kushindwa kupokea data ya mtandao."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "problem with the local client certificate."
msgstr "tatizo na cheti cha mteja wa ndani."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not use specified cipher."
msgstr "Haikuweza kutumia msimbofiche uliobainishwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The remote server's SSL certificate or SSH fingerprint was deemed not OK. This error code has been unified with CURLE_SSL_CACERT since 7.62.0. Its previous value was 51."
msgstr "Cheti cha SSL au alama ya kidole ya SSH ya seva ya mbali ilionekana kuwa si sawa. Msimbo huu wa hitilafu umeunganishwa na CURLE_SSL_CACERT tangu 7.62.0. Thamani yake ya awali ilikuwa 51."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unrecognized transfer encoding."
msgstr "Usimbaji wa uhamishaji usiotambulika."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Maximum file size exceeded."
msgstr "Ukubwa wa juu wa faili umepitwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requested FTP SSL level failed."
msgstr "Kiwango cha FTP SSL kilichoombwa kilishindikana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When doing a send operation curl had to rewind the data to retransmit, but the rewinding operation failed."
msgstr "Wakati wa kufanya operesheni ya kutuma, curl ilibidi irudishe data nyuma ili kutuma tena, lakini operesheni ya kurudisha nyuma ilishindwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Initiating the SSL Engine failed."
msgstr "Kuanzisha Injini ya SSL kumeshindwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The remote server denied curl to login (Added in 7.13.1)"
msgstr "Seva ya mbali ilikataa curl kuingia (Iliongezwa katika 7.13.1)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "File not found on TFTP server."
msgstr "Faili haikupatikana kwenye seva ya TFTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Permission problem on TFTP server."
msgstr "Tatizo la ruhusa kwenye seva ya TFTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Out of disk space on the server."
msgstr "Nafasi ya diski imeisha kwenye seva."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Illegal TFTP operation."
msgstr "Operesheni haramu ya TFTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unknown TFTP transfer ID."
msgstr "Kitambulisho cha uhamishaji wa TFTP kisichojulikana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "File already exists and is not overwritten."
msgstr "Faili tayari ipo na haijaandikwa upya."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This error should never be returned by a properly functioning TFTP server."
msgstr "Kosa hili halipaswi kamwe kurejeshwa na seva ya TFTP inayofanya kazi ipasavyo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Problem with reading the SSL CA cert (path? access rights?)"
msgstr "Tatizo la kusoma cheti cha SSL CA (njia? haki za ufikiaji?)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The resource referenced in the URL does not exist."
msgstr "Rasilimali iliyorejelewa katika URL haipo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An unspecified error occurred during the SSH session."
msgstr "Hitilafu isiyobainishwa ilitokea wakati wa kipindi cha SSH."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to shut down the SSL connection."
msgstr "Imeshindwa kufunga muunganisho wa SSL."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Socket is not ready for send/recv wait till it's ready and try again. This return code is only returned from curl_easy_recv and curl_easy_send (Added in 7.18.2)"
msgstr "Soketi haiko tayari kutuma/kupokea subiri hadi iwe tayari na ujaribu tena. Msimbo huu wa kurejesha unarejeshwa tu kutoka kwa curl_easy_recv na curl_easy_send (Imeongezwa katika 7.18.2)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to load CRL file (Added in 7.19.0)"
msgstr "Imeshindwa kupakia faili ya CRL (Iliongezwa katika 7.19.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Issuer check failed (Added in 7.19.0)"
msgstr "Ukaguzi wa mtoaji umeshindwa (Iliongezwa katika 7.19.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP server does not understand the PRET command at all or does not support the given argument. Be careful when using CURLOPT_CUSTOMREQUEST, a custom LIST command is sent with the PRET command before PASV as well. (Added in 7.20.0)"
msgstr "Seva ya FTP haielewi amri ya PRET kabisa au haitumii hoja iliyotolewa. Kuwa mwangalifu unapotumia CURLOPT_CUSTOMREQUEST, amri maalum ya LIST hutumwa pamoja na amri ya PRET kabla ya PASV pia. (Imeongezwa katika 7.20.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Mismatch of RTSP CSeq numbers."
msgstr "Kutolingana kwa nambari za RTSP CSeq."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Mismatch of RTSP Session Identifiers."
msgstr "Kutolingana kwa Vitambulishi vya Kipindi vya RTSP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unable to parse FTP file list (during FTP wildcard downloading)."
msgstr "Imeshindwa kuchanganua orodha ya faili za FTP (wakati wa kupakua kwa alama badala ya FTP)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Chunk callback reported error."
msgstr "Mwitiko wa kipande umeripoti hitilafu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "(For internal use only, is never returned by libcurl) No connection available, the session is queued. (added in 7.30.0)"
msgstr "(Kwa matumizi ya ndani pekee, hairudishwi kamwe na libcurl) Hakuna muunganisho unaopatikana, kipindi kimewekwa kwenye foleni. (imeongezwa katika 7.30.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to match the pinned key specified with CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY."
msgstr "Imeshindwa kulinganisha ufunguo uliobandikwa uliobainishwa na CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Status returned failure when asked with CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYSTATUS."
msgstr "Hali ilirejesha kutofaulu ilipoulizwa na CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYSTATUS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Stream error in the HTTP/2 framing layer."
msgstr "Hitilafu ya mtiririko katika safu ya uundaji wa fremu ya HTTP/2."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An API function was called from inside a callback."
msgstr "Kitendakazi cha API kiliitwa kutoka ndani ya callback."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An authentication function returned an error."
msgstr "Kitendakazi cha uthibitishaji kilirejesha hitilafu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem was detected in the HTTP/3 layer. This is somewhat generic and can be one out of several problems, see the error buffer for details."
msgstr "Tatizo liligunduliwa katika safu ya HTTP/3. Hili ni la kijumla kiasi na linaweza kuwa mojawapo ya matatizo kadhaa, angalia bafa ya hitilafu kwa maelezo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "QUIC connection error. This error may be caused by an SSL library error. QUIC is the protocol used for HTTP/3 transfers."
msgstr "Hitilafu ya muunganisho wa QUIC. Hitilafu hii inaweza kusababishwa na hitilafu ya maktaba ya SSL. QUIC ni itifaki inayotumika kwa uhamishaji wa HTTP/3."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Proxy handshake error. CURLINFO_PROXY_ERROR provides extra details on the specific problem."
msgstr "Hitilafu ya mawasiliano ya awali ya proksi. CURLINFO_PROXY_ERROR hutoa maelezo ya ziada kuhusu tatizo mahususi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSL Client Certificate required."
msgstr "Cheti cha Mteja wa SSL kinahitajika."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An internal call to poll() or select() returned error that is not recoverable."
msgstr "Wito wa ndani kwa poll() au select() ulirejesha hitilafu ambayo haiwezi kurekebishwa."

