msgstr "Mipangilio ya Ukaguzi wa HTTP/HTTPS"

#: setup.php
msgid "User Agent"
msgstr "Wakala wa Mtumiaji"

#: setup.php
msgid "The User-Agent string sent with HTTP/HTTPS and other cURL based service checks. Some sites block old or uncommon browsers, so you can set a current User-Agent here. Leave blank to use the built-in default."
msgstr "Mfuatano wa User-Agent unaotumwa na ukaguzi wa huduma wa HTTP/HTTPS na mwingine unaotegemea cURL. Baadhi ya tovuti huzuia vivinjari vya zamani au visivyo vya kawaida, kwa hivyo unaweza kuweka User-Agent ya sasa hapa. Acha wazi ili kutumia chaguo-msingi iliyojengwa ndani."

